 "strings": {
  "Yes sir!": "",
  "This guy's tougher than he looks...": "",
  "Keep him busy, boys.": "",
  "This guy won't give up...": "",
  "Get in there, boys.": "",
  "Heh, I've been waiting for you.": "",
  "Heh, took you long enough.": "",
  "Dammit! Gonna have to try something else...": "",
  "Let's do this, Yagami!": "",
  "Dammit, stupid gun...": "",
  "Dammit, that's not working...": "",
  "Finally. I was getting bored of waiting.": "",
  "Finally. I was gettin' bored.": "",
  "Hrgh!": "",
  "Don't worry 'bout me!\nJust go find Kaito-san!": "",
  "You think I'd let you do that?": "",
  "You think I'm gonna let you do that?": "",
  "You never learn, huh?": "",
  "Hrgh... Heh, not bad.": "",
  "I'm done playing.\nTime to go in for the kill!": "",
  "Time to go in for the kill!": "",
  "We've got to go, Matsugane-san!": "",
  "Let's get out of here, Matsugane-san!": "",
  "Right! Leave Hamura to me!": "",
  "Don't just stand there!\nHelp me, you fucks!": "",
  "Tak! Do whatever you can to\nkeep them away from us!": "",
  "Tak! Keep them away from us!": "",
  "Got it!": "",
  "Sorry 'bout this, Boss!": "",
  "Guh!": "",
  "Heh, appreciate it!": "",
  "Dammit...": "",
  "I'm gonna tear you apart!": "",
  "I'm gonna tear you limb from limb!": "",
  "I'll handle this, stay back.": "",
  "Heh...": "",
  "Not so fast!": "",
  "What is it this time?": "",
  "...Sugiura?": "",
  "This isn't funny, man!\nWhere are you?": "",
  "...Dammit!": "",
  "You've got this!": "",
  "Get him!": "",
  "Mafuyu!": "",
  "Not happening!": "",
  "Thank you, Yagami-kun!": "",
  "Keep going!": "",
  "Will do!": "",
  "What, no love for me, Mafuyu-chan?": "",
  "Hang in there too, Kaito-san!": "",
  "You hang in there too, Kaito-san!": "",
  "Now we're talking!": "",
  "That's what I'm talkin' about!": "",
  "Alright! Mafuyu-chan's watching...\nSo let's not screw this up!": "",
  "Mafuyu-chan's watchin' us...\nNo backing down!": "",
  "Right!": "",
  "Mafuyu...": "",
  "This way!": "",
  "Piece of shit...": "",
  "Dammit, these guys\nwon't stop comin' on us!": "",
  "Uh... I meant at us!": "",
  "Uh... Wait, I meant for us!": "",
  "Dude, that's gross.": "",
  "Was that really necessary?": "",
  "C'mon, that ain't what I meant!": "",
  "Keep your head in the game,\nKaito-san. Now let's go!": "",
  "You okay?": "",
  "Yeah, somehow.": "",
  "Hey, you okay man?": "",
  "Yagami-san!\nAre you okay?": "",
  "We're gonna need another way in...": "",
  "What about the underground parking lot? \nThe same way we got in before.": "",
  "Good idea, Yagami-san! That'll get us into the hospital.\nWe can get to the research wing from there.": "",
  "Good idea, Yagami-san!\nWe can get to the research wing from the hospital, right?": "",
  "Especially now that we have the keycard.": "",
  "That might work.": "",
  "Then we've gotta try.\nWe can't let Kuroiwa get away with this!": "",
  "Crap...": "",
  "Careful, now!": "",
  "Huh? The hell're you doing!?": "",
  "What do you want!?": "",
  "Who're you!?": "",
  "You bastard!": "",
  "Help me! Someone help me!": "",
  "...Damn it!": "",
  "This is Shono.": "",
  "Hello? This is Shono.": "",
  "30 seconds!?\nJust get over here!": "",
  "Thirty seconds!?\nFine, but please hurry!": "",
  "There you are!": "",
  "Two minutes!?\n...Please come faster!": "",
  "I won't go easy on you...": "",
  "You need two whole minutes!?": "",
  "Three minutes!?\nI can't wait for three minutes!": "",
  "Three minutes!? Please get here quicker than that!": "",
  "Now you're fucked!": "",
  "This time you're dead!": "",
  "Four minutes!? That's too slow!": "",
  "It won't take you five minutes!": "",
  "I'll have support in 30 seconds!": "",
  "I'll have support in one minute!": "",
  "I-I'm in front of Dayroom!": "",
  "I'm at the admissions building!": "",
  "Why isn't it going through!\nDamn it!": "",
  "What are my supports doing...!": "",
  "Yagami-san!\nBetter luck next time!": "",
  "Great job! Keep it up!": "",
  "What are you doing!?": "",
  "Tch, support was just about to...": "",
  "S-Stop!": "",
  "It must be them!": "",
  "Yagami, you bastard!": "",
  "You fools again!": "",
  "They just keep on coming...": "",
  "Shono, wait!": "",
  "What's with this guy!?\nShould probably keep my distance for now...": "",
  "Where the hell are ya!?": "",
  "I'm gonna tear ya apart!": "",
  "I don't see him at all!!": "",
  "Where the hell did he go!?": "",
  "The more I drink, the stronger I get!": "",
  "Yo!": "",
  "Whoops...": "",
  "Whoa...": "",
  "Whoa... Urp.": "",
  "Huff... Huff...": "",
  "Warm this up for me.": "",
  "Oh damn.": "",
  "What are you guys doing!?": "",
  "They finally give up?": "",
  "Did they give up?": "",
  "Give me a break...": "",
  "Can I borrow this real quick?": "",
  "Sorry, can I borrow this real quick!?": "",
  "Uhh... Sure...": "",
  "Tch... ": "",
  "...Tch!": "",
  "Hm!? Is that...!?": "",
  "Alright...!": "",
  "Hmmmm?": "",
  "The fuck's your problem?": "",
  "Hey, you bastard!": "",
  "You wanna die, huh!?": "",
  "Dieeee!": "",
  "Please, I said I'm sorry!": "",
  "I'm real sorry...": "",
  "You worthless piece of shit.": "",
  "You're wasting my time...!": "",
  "Don't resist!": "",
  "I've captured him!": "",
  "I'm not letting you get away!": "",
  "H-Hey... Wait!": "",
  "Hell no!": "",
  "G-Got him!": "",
  "We got him!": "",
  "W-We need backup!": "",
  "No more... running...": "",
  "I won't... let you get away...": "",
  "Heh, you didn't think this through.": "",
  "Got you!": "",
  "(He went toward Pink Street.\nI should check the map, get my bearings.)": "",
  "(Well, time to get over there.)": "",
  "You close yet, Tak?": "",
  "Hey. You close yet, Tak?": "",
  "Getting there.": "",
  "I think he's gettin' suspicious of me.\nMust be pretty perceptive.": "",
  "Damn, he's onto me.\nGood luck, Tak. It's all you now.": "",
  "Damn, he's onto me...\nIt's all up to you now. Good luck.": "",
  "Really? I need more time!": "",
  "Do something. I need more time!": "",
  "Just get your ass over here.\nIf we lose him, it's on you.": "",
  "Do what? Just get your ass over here.\nIf we lose him, it's on you.": "",
  "Well, that's just rude.": "",
  "(What did the detective look like again?\nShould probably take another look at our sketch.)": "",
  "(His hat's pretty unique.\nInteresting jacket, too.)": "",
  "(He has a distinctive mole on his face,\nfive-o-clock shadow, and almond-shaped eyes.)": "",
  "(It's the kind of face that someone not used to this city\nmight feel intimidated by.)": "",
  "(Okay, time to see if anyone fits the bill.)": "",
  "(All right, I'm at Pink Street...)": "",
  "Found him.": "",
  "Ah... There we go. Found him.": "",
  "Finally. Thought you were\nnever gonna catch up, man.": "",
  "Thought you'd never catch up, man.": "",
  "(Is this our guy?)": "",
  "(Nope. Let's see who else is around.)": "",
  "Kaito-san. He's heading for\nthe Champion District.": "",
  "Kaito-san. He's heading for\nthe Champion District. ": "",
  "Oh, great. We're never gonna\nfind him in that maze.": "",
  "The Champion District?\nWe can't track him in that maze...": "",
  "Probably why he's going there.": "",
  "Yeah. That's probably why\nhe's going there.": "",
  "Thankfully, we can always\nfollow him from above.": "",
  "Well... That's fine by me.\nSounds like a job for the Pigeon.": "",
  "Yeah? Wanna break out the Pigeon?": "",
  "Yeah? Wanna break out the drone?": "",
  "Just try to head him off, Kaito-san.\nAnd be ready.": "",
  "Kaito-san, you try heading him off,\nthen wait for my signal.": "",
  "Got it! I'm on the way!": "",
  "Oh, and try not to get carried away.\nCan't afford to get that thing fixed again.": "",
  "Oh, and try not to get carried away.\nCan't afford to fix it again.": "",
  "Yeah, yeah.\nJust don't lose him.": "",
  "Yeah, yeah. Just don't lose him.": "",
  "He just ducked into an empty lot, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Kaito-san. He just ducked into an empty lot\nin the Champion District.": "",
  "Dead end.\nWe follow him, we blow our cover.": "",
  "I can't follow him into a dead end.\nI'd blow our cover.": "",
  "Whaddya think he's doing in there?": "",
  "Figures... What's he doing\nin there?": "",
  "Probably meeting someone\nhe doesn't wanna be seen with.": "",
  "Probably meeting someone. Maybe someone\nhe doesn't want to be seen meeting.": "",
  "Makes sense. Pigeon's up.\nCan you see it?": "",
  "Makes sense. By the way, the Pigeon's up and flying.\nCan you see it?": "",
  "Hold on.": "",
  "Give me a second to look...": "",
  "There it is.": "",
  "Ah, okay. There it is.": "",
  "Hold on.\nI'll send the feed to your phone.": "",
  "Check your phone.\nI'm sending you the bird's-eye view.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(What's that light?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Oh, just a sign. That's not it.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(That's no Pigeon. That's a cat.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(What's he doing in a place\nlike this?)</color>": "",
  "Nice flying, Kaito-san. Keep it steady.\nYou been practicing?": "",
  "Now's not a good time, Tak!\nGotta concentrate...": "",
  "Hm? There's another guy\nin there with him.": "",
  "Hm? Take a look at that.\nSomeone's in there with him.": "",
  "So he is meeting someone.": "",
  "So he <font_kind=yakuza_italic>is</font_kind> meeting someone.": "",
  "Hey, I know that guy.\nHe's a bookie for horse races.": "",
  "...I know that guy. He's a bookie\nfor horse races in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Tryin' to gamble his way to paying off\ndebts, huh? Because that always works.": "",
  "A bookie? So instead of payin' his debts off,\nhe's doin' <font_kind=yakuza_italic>more</font_kind> gambling? Real model citizen.": "",
  "Yeah, well, if they came all\nthe way out here just to meet...": "",
  "But if they came all the way\nout here just to meet...": "",
  "He must have the cash on him.": "",
  "...He must have the cash on him.": "",
  "We'll get what we need\nif we move now.": "",
  "You remember what we're\ndoing here, right?": "",
  "...You remember the mission, right?": "",
  "Collecting the debt that detective owes.": "",
  "Ohhh, I get it.\nThis is our chance!": "",
  "...I get it.\nThis is our chance!": "",
  "Just relax and let me\ndo my thing, okay?": "",
  "Sit back and watch.\nLet me do my thing, okay?": "",
  "You got it, Tak.\nDon't fuck it up!": "",
  "Then go get 'em, Tak.\nDon't fuck this up!": "",
  "Nice night, huh Detective?": "",
  "Evening! How's it going, detective?": "",
  "I hear the bookies in Kamurocho\nmake some pretty good deals.": "",
  "I hear Kamurocho bookies\nmake pretty good deals.": ""
 },
